                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Gideoni yaabagira ati: Nyine eki ndikubashaba; buri muntu ampe empeta z'omu matu ezi anyagire. (Ahakuba Abamidiani bakaba bajwara empeta z'ezaabu omu matu, ahabw'okuba bakaba bari Abaishimaeli.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baamugarukamu bati: Twaza kuzikuha n'omutima gwekundiire. Baayara omwenda ahansi, buri muntu yaanagaho empeta z'omu matu ezi anyagire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oburemeezi bw'empeta zaabo ez'ezaabu z'omu matu ezi yaashabire bwaba shekeli z'ezaabu rukumi na magana mushanju, otabariiremu birezi n'eby'okwehunda n'ebijwaro bya bujwa ebyabaire bijwarwa abagabe ba Midiani, kandi otataireho mikuufu ey'omu bitsya by'engamira zaabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
