              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Gideoni yaabikoramu efodi, yaagita omu rurembo rwe orurikwetwa Ofura; Abaisraeli boona baaguma nibazayo kugiramya nk'abarikuraaya; yaaba omutego ahari Gideoni n'ab'omu ka ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batyo Abamidiani baasingurwa Abaisraeli, tibaagaruka kwimutsya mutwe obundi. Ensi yaahuumura okumara emyaka makumi ana omu busingye bwa Gideoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.28",
